    THE ZERO ROW IS THE BIAS: the estimator returns sig2 -0.00167 on a
    league that has NO dispersion, so that much is subtracted below. It is
    the state-blind approximation declared in the docstring, showing up as
    residual the model cannot account for.

  THE MEASUREMENT, BIAS-CORRECTED
    raw sig2          +0.02203   (sigma +0.1484)
    minus bias        -0.00167
