  AGAINST THE TUNED VALUE. 0.20 means sig2 0.04000; this counts 0.02642 calibrated (+0.02369 raw).
  Raw is +4.2 sd from the tuned value, so 0.20 is NOT supported.
  THE HONEST STATEMENT: the league carries real per-start strikeout
  dispersion, and it is roughly 0.16 — smaller than the 0.20 that made
  the K distribution land on target. So sharpness is REAL and PARTIAL.
